-DATASET ICEBUG-DISK ice-disk-test
--

-CASE LatePropertiesOfIceDiskNodes
-LOG Icebug-disk nodes keep their properties: each query returns what its single-part form returns
-STATEMENT MATCH (a:user) RETURN a.name ORDER BY a.id LIMIT 2
-CHECK_ORDER
---- 2
Noura
Adam
-STATEMENT MATCH (a:user) WITH a ORDER BY a.id LIMIT 2 RETURN a.name
-CHECK_ORDER
---- 2
Noura
Adam
-STATEMENT MATCH (a:user)-[:follows]->(b:user) RETURN b.name, count(*) ORDER BY b.name
---- 4
Adam|3
Karissa|1
Noura|1
Zhang|2
-STATEMENT MATCH (a:user)-[:follows]->(b:user) UNWIND [1] AS x WITH b, count(*) AS c RETURN b.name, c ORDER BY b.name
---- 4
Adam|3
Karissa|1
Noura|1
Zhang|2
